    "created_at": "2024-10-07T20:23:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-10-07T20:31:29Z",
    "body": "BiDi spec has [one example](https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#type-network-BytesValue) that encodes binary data, and that seems to refer to [forgiving-base64 encode](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#forgiving-base64-decode). Perhaps it makes sense for BiDi to (re-)export a definition that allows other specs to link to the correct way to encode binary data.\r\n\r\n/cc @OrKoN ",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
