    "created_at": "2024-10-08T05:35:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-10-08T05:35:22Z",
    "body": "Yes, using base64 and a text string is currently recommended for binary data if the size is relatively small and can be inline in a protocol message. ",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
