    "created_at": "2024-10-08T14:16:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-10-08T14:16:04Z",
    "body": "To clarify, I think referencing the [base64 algorithm](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#forgiving-base64) in the infra spec is sufficient as we do not have a central place to handle binary data in the WebDriver BiDi spec. Also from the client and implementation perspective the format is command/event-specific and we do not expect to change/specify it centrally. If we have a better way in the future, we can re-visit but so far I know know of plans to have a better way to deal with large binary files but I do not think a solution for that would be applicable here since CDP also implements this data as base64-encoded strings. ",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
